OL,3,AFather of suspect in Australian MP
OL,4,Aattack says politician was long-time
OL,5,Afamily friend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe father of the suspect in an attack
OL,8,Fon an Australian MP yesterday says the
OL,9,Fpolitician was a long-time family
OL,10,Ffriend
OL,12,FThe suspect was named by local media as
OL,13,FBrendan Nugent, 43, an environmental
OL,14,Fcampaigner in the area
OL,16,FHis father, Rod, says he and his
OL,17,Fpartner were friends with Helen Haines
OL,18,F"for more than 20 years", and calls the
OL,19,Fattack "devastating and unfathomable"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
