OL,3,AFather of suspect in Australian MP
OL,4,Aattack says politician was long-time
OL,5,Afamily friend
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaines, 65, is in a critical but stable
OL,8,Fcondition and has reportedly lost a leg
OL,9,Fafter being hit by the suspect's car
OL,10,Foutside her office in Victoria
OL,12,FA local barber, Ricky Jefferies, says
OL,13,Fhe pulled the suspect from the car and
OL,14,Fthrew away his knife - another person
OL,15,Fsat in front of the car, he says
OL,17,FThe suspect allegedly did a U-turn in
OL,18,Forder to strike the MP and then
OL,19,Freversed to ram her a second time, Home
OL,20,FAffairs Minister Tony Burke says
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
